  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "9.0.0 · 2026-08-15\n\t\t\t【破坏性】BLL 去 MVC 依赖（分层解耦）：新增 ApiResult / ApiResult<TData>，BLL 全部 Task<IActionResult> 方法改为返回 ApiResult（Controller 层统一 ToActionResult 映射）；WebApiResponse / IWebApiResponse 响应构造迁至 Controller 包；IWebApiBaseBLL / IDomain 不再继承 IWebApiResponse，WebApiBaseBLL / BaseDomain 不再继承 WebApiResponse；DatabaseExtensions（IApplicationBuilder 扩展）迁至 Controller 包；删除 Microsoft.AspNetCore.App FrameworkReference，改引 Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Binder\n\t\t\t【破坏性】ReadWriteRouting.BindReadToWrite 静态开关改为 ReadWriteRoutingOptions（注册单例由 DI 注入 BaseDAL），原静态属性已移除\n\t\t\t【优化】CacheManager.VersionLocalCacheTtl / MaxThrottleEntries 由 static 改实例属性；MyDbContextFactory 提供 protected virtual CreateWriteInstance / CreateReadOnlyInstance 钩子（派生类可定制上下文创建）",
